This directory contains tests that mostly require manual inspection of the
results. GRandomUsage, PlotRNGDistributions and DependentDistributionTests
write files from which the ROOT analysis toolkit (http://root.cern.ch) draws
random number distributions, for a look by eye.

GRandomThroughput measures raw proxy throughput for a single random-number
source (--source), but is sort-bound and does not differentiate the sources.
